description	"Pirate Cutthroat

^2Weaponry:
- Dirk
-- ^5Cyan ^7/ ^4Blue ^7Styles
-- Melee / Ranged Defense (1)
- Grenadoes [1 Frag Grenade]

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- BP Free Jumps

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]

Cutthroats are ruthless, and take no prisoners. He carries a grenado, which was a precursor to the modern hand greande. He also carries a dirk, which was either a long knife or a cut down sword blade on a dagger hilt."